{"seq":3,"slug":"copolymerization-controlled-radical","title":"共聚与可控/活性自由基聚合（ATRP·RAFT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/copolymerization-controlled-radical","wordCount":1464,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"共聚与可控-活性自由基聚合-atrp-raft\">共聚与可控/活性自由基聚合（ATRP·RAFT）</h1><p>把苯乙烯和丁二烯一起聚合，能得到比任一均聚物都更好用的丁苯橡胶；用 ATRP 精确接出一段亲水链、再续一段疏水链，就得到能在水中自组装成胶束的两亲嵌段共聚物。前者说明「混进第二种单体」能改写性能，后者说明「精确控制链怎么长」能创造全新功能。这一篇把<a href=\"chain-growth-polymerization\">链式聚合</a>推进两步：先讲共聚的序列控制，再讲让自由基聚合变得「可控/活性」的关键技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>共聚</strong>是把两种或多种单体共同聚合到同一条链上。链上单体的排列方式产生四种序列结构——无规、交替、嵌段、接枝——每种对应不同性能。决定无规共聚序列的是<strong>竞聚率</strong>（reactivity ratio）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它们刻画一个增长末端「更愿意加同种还是异种单体」。瞬时共聚物组成由共聚方程描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{d[M_1]}{d[M_2]} = \\frac{[M_1]}{[M_2]} \\cdot \\frac{r_1 [M_1] + [M_2]}{[M_2] + r_2 [M_1]}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></sp