=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而<strong>可控/活性自由基聚合</strong>（CRP/RDRP）的核心思想，是把绝大多数链维持在「休眠态」、只让极少数瞬时「活化」增长，从而压低同时存在的活性自由基浓度、大幅减少双基终止——既保留自由基聚合对单体宽容、操作简便的优点，又获得阴离子活性聚合的窄分布与精确链长。</p>\n<p>下图给出可控自由基聚合的休眠—活化平衡骨架：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[休眠链&lt;br/&gt;P-X 占多数] --&gt;|活化| B[活性自由基 P·&lt;br/&gt;瞬时极少]&#10;  B --&gt;|加单体增长| C[链增长一小段]&#10;  C --&gt;|失活/钝化| A&#10;  B -.偶尔双基终止.-&gt; D[死链&lt;br/&gt;被抑制到极少]&#10;  A --&gt; E[全部链同步缓慢增长&lt;br/&gt;窄分布 Đ&lt;1.2]\">flowchart TD\n  A[休眠链&lt;br/&gt;P-X 占多数] --&gt;|活化| B[活性自由基 P·&lt;br/&gt;瞬时极少]\n  B --&gt;|加单体增长| C[链增长一小段]\n  C --&gt;|失活/钝化| A\n  B -.偶尔双基终止.-&gt; D[死链&lt;br/&gt;被抑制到极少]\n  A --&gt; E[全部链同步缓慢增长&lt;br/&gt;窄分布 Đ&lt;1.2]</pre><p>不同序列结构与可控方法对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序列结构</th>\n<th>竞聚率特征</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无规</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 r_2 \\approx 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6331em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>改性通用塑料、丁苯橡胶</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交替</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, r_2 \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>特种功能材料</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌段</td>\n<td>由活性/可控聚合制得</td>\n<td>热塑性弹性体、自组装载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接枝</td>\n<td>大分子单体/接枝</td>\n<td>相容剂、刷状聚合物</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"竞聚率与共聚物组成漂移\">竞聚率与共聚物组成漂移</h2><p>竞聚率不仅预测序列，还预警一个工艺陷阱：组成漂移。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 \\neq r_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，活性更强的单体会被优先消耗，反应早期生成的链与晚期生成的链组成不同，产物成为组成不均的混合物。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 r_2 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 为理想共聚（随机排列），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1 = r_2 = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 趋于严格交替，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1, r_2 &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 则倾向各自成段乃至嵌段化。工业上通过半连续补加活性单体来抵消漂移、保持组成恒定。共聚物组成最终决定相容性与相分离行为，进而影响<a href=\"../structure-property/mechanical-rheological-properties\">力学性能</a>与<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">物理态</a>中多相体系的表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"atrp-原子转移自由基聚合\">ATRP：原子转移自由基聚合</h2><p>ATRP 用过渡金属配合物（经典为铜/胺配体）在低价态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cu^{I}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">I</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与高价态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Cu^{II}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8413em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">II</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 之间穿梭，可逆地从休眠链 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mtext>-</mtext><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P\\text{-}X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>（卤代端基）夺取卤原子生成活性自由基，又把卤原子还回去使其重新休眠。这个氧化还原平衡把活性自由基浓度死死压低，分散度可达 1.1 以下，分子量随转化率线性增长且可由单体/引发剂比预设。近年研究的重点是降低金属用量与提升操作友好性：<strong>光诱导 ATRP</strong>（photo-ATRP）通过光还原原位再生活化态，把铜催化剂用量降到 ppm 级；2026 年前后报道的双光氧化还原/铜协同催化体系，甚至实现了绿光驱动、可在开放空气下进行的 ATRP，显著改善了对氧气敏感这一长期工程障碍（<a href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC9557244/\">Open-air green-light-driven ATRP, PMC</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"raft-可逆加成-断裂链转移聚合\">RAFT：可逆加成-断裂链转移聚合</h2><p>RAFT 不用金属，而用一种含硫的链转移剂（RAFT 试剂，二硫代酯/三硫代碳酸酯类）。增长自由基可逆地加成到 RAFT 试剂的 C=S 双键上、再断裂释放出另一条链的自由基，活性像「击鼓传花」般在所有链间快速来回传递，使每条链获得几乎相同的增长机会，从而窄分布。RAFT 对单体的宽容度极高（含丙烯酸、丙烯酰胺、乙烯酯等），并能在水相、生物相容条件下进行，特别适合制备<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/functional-biomedical-polymers\">功能与生物医用高分子</a>。以 RAFT 试剂作光引发剂的 <strong>PET-RAFT</strong> 进一步实现了温和光控、可时空调控的精密合成（<a href=\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC6415088/\">Recent Advances in RAFT, PMC</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"atrp-与-raft-的取舍及精密架构\">ATRP 与 RAFT 的取舍及精密架构</h2><p>两法目标相同——窄分布、可设计链——但路线不同，各有取舍：ATRP 端基带卤、易后修饰，但需金属催化剂与脱除；RAFT 无金属、单体兼容广，但留有含硫端基且 RAFT 试剂需定制。Nature Reviews 的系统比较指出二者在链长、组成、分散度、端基控制上能力相当，选择取决于单体类型与下游应用（<a href=\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41570-021-00328-8\">RAFT vs ATRP, Nature Reviews Chemistry</a>）。它们共同的力量在于能搭建嵌段、星形、刷状、梯度等复杂架构——这正是当代刺激响应材料、药物载体、纳米结构自组装的合成底座，其应用全面展开于<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/functional-biomedical-polymers\">功能高分子与生物医用材料</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>下图汇总共聚与可控聚合的核心：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[精密合成] --&gt; B[共聚&lt;br/&gt;竞聚率 r1 r2]&#10;  B --&gt; C[序列:无规/交替/嵌段/接枝]&#10;  B --&gt; D[组成漂移]&#10;  A --&gt; E[可控自由基聚合&lt;br/&gt;休眠-活化平衡]&#10;  E --&gt; F[ATRP&lt;br/&gt;铜氧化还原]&#10;  E --&gt; G[RAFT&lt;br/&gt;含硫链转移]&#10;  F --&gt; H[复杂架构&lt;br/&gt;嵌段/星形/刷状]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[精密合成] --&gt; B[共聚&lt;br/&gt;竞聚率 r1 r2]\n  B --&gt; C[序列:无规/交替/嵌段/接枝]\n  B --&gt; D[组成漂移]\n  A --&gt; E[可控自由基聚合&lt;br/&gt;休眠-活化平衡]\n  E --&gt; F[ATRP&lt;br/&gt;铜氧化还原]\n  E --&gt; G[RAFT&lt;br/&gt;含硫链转移]\n  F --&gt; H[复杂架构&lt;br/&gt;嵌段/星形/刷状]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><ul>\n<li>共聚把多种单体编入一条链，序列（无规/交替/嵌段/接枝）由<strong>竞聚率</strong>决定，并可能引发组成漂移。</li>\n<li>可控自由基聚合用「休眠—活化」平衡压低活性自由基浓度、抑制双基终止，得窄分布与可设计链长。</li>\n<li><strong>ATRP</strong> 靠铜氧化还原穿梭控制平衡；光诱导/绿光开放空气体系大幅降低金属用量与氧敏感性。</li>\n<li><strong>RAFT</strong> 靠含硫试剂在链间快速转移活性，无金属、单体宽容，PET-RAFT 实现光时空调控。</li>\n<li>二者能力相当、按需取舍，共同支撑复杂架构合成，是<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/functional-biomedical-polymers\">功能与生物医用材料</a>的技术底座。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共聚与可控/活性自由基聚合（ATRP·RAFT）","id":"共聚与可控-活性自由基聚合-atrp-raft"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"竞聚率与共聚物组成漂移","id":"竞聚率与共聚物组成漂移"},{"level":2,"text":"ATRP：原子转移自由基聚合","id":"atrp-原子转移自由基聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"RAFT：可逆加成-断裂链转移聚合","id":"raft-可逆加成-断裂链转移聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"ATRP 与 RAFT 的取舍及精密架构","id":"atrp-与-raft-的取舍及精密架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"链式聚合（自由基与离子）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/chain-growth-polymerization"},"next":{"title":"高分子物理态（玻璃化与结晶）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/structure-property/polymer-physical-states"}}